<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Theoretical Equivalence to Classical Minimal Sufficient Statistics ‣ WaterVIB: Learning Minimal Sufficient Watermark Representations via Variational Information Bottleneck" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>Theorem 3: Information Minimality Implies Classical MSS</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
